d 'SRIINEI': module to download microdata modules from Peru's INEI official statistics portal
d
d  sriinei downloads a specified module of public microdata from
d the SRIENAHO portal of Peru's National Institute of Statistics
d and Informatics (INEI), given the survey code and module number
d as they appear in the portal's own download URLs. The command
d works for any survey published on the portal, not just one
d specific survey, since it does not embed any survey-specific
d catalog of years or module numbers. 
d
d KW: data management
d KW: Peru
d
d Requires: Stata version 14 
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260730
d
d Author: Andres Talavera Cuya,   Direccion Nacional de Censos y Encuestas -- INEI Peru
d Support: email talaveracuya@@gmail.com
d
f sriinei.ado
f sriinei.sthlp
